            md=(
                "Queue files are YAML with this shape:\n"
                "```yaml\n"
                "version: 0\n"
                "name: \"my-queue\"\n"
                "defaults:\n"
                "  provider: gemini\n"
                "  posture: safe\n"
                "  backend: bwrap              # podman|bwrap|kvm\n"
                "  cwd: /workspace\n"
                "  timeout_s: 600              # optional\n"
                "  env_allowlist: []           # env vars copied from host env into provider sandbox\n"
                "\n"
                "  # Provider session behavior\n"
                "  resume_policy: never        # never|always|resume|resume-last\n"
                "  resume_start: false         # if true, allow a one-time 'start new session' fallback on step 1\n"
                "  model_fallbacks: true       # if false, wrappers won't try alternate models\n"
                "  retries: 0                  # provider exec retries (0 = single-shot)\n"
                "  retry_delay_s: 0            # delay between provider retries\n"
                "  tty: false                  # if true, provider exec attaches to your terminal (no captured stdout/stderr)\n"
                "\n"
                "  # Sandbox execution behavior (after/expect)\n"
                "  network: host               # host|none|auto|default|bridge|slirp4netns|pasta|pasta:...|custom-name(regex)\n"
                "  offline: false              # if true, forces network=none\n"
                "  strict: false               # if true, uses more conservative defaults (e.g. avoid host net)\n"
                "  expose_private: false       # mounts /workspace/.sandworm/private read-only (debug injector)\n"
                "  kvm_instance: null          # optional; name for KVM backend\n"
                "\n"
                "  # queue validate is strict for known fields: invalid types/bounds fail closed.\n"
                "  # malformed defaults type (non-mapping) is warning-only and treated as empty.\n"
                "\n"
                "steps:\n"
                "  - id: \"01\"\n"
                "    title: \"Do thing\"\n"
                "    prompt: |\n"
                "      Tell the provider what to do.\n"
                "    after:\n"
                "      - where: sandbox         # sandbox|host\n"
                "        run: [\"sh\",\"-lc\",\"echo hello\"]\n"
                "        capture: onfail        # always|onfail|never\n"
                "        timeout_s: 60          # optional\n"
                "    expect:\n"
                "      command_succeeds:\n"
                "        - [\"sh\",\"-lc\",\"test -f /workspace/output.txt\"]\n"
                "      files_exist:\n"
                "        - \"output.txt\"\n"
                "      exit_code: 0             # optional: asserts last command exit code\n"
                "    artifacts:\n"
                "      - \"output/**\"\n"
                "    inputs:\n"
                "      - \"README.md\"           # metadata only (recorded in manifest.json)\n"
                "```\n"
                "\n"
                "Important semantics:\n"
                "- Provider execution only happens when you pass `sandworm queue run --providers ...`.\n"
                "  Without `--providers`, queue will still run `after:` and `expect:` actions.\n"
                "- `provider: none` skips provider execution for that step.\n"
                "- `provider: noop` is a no-op provider that always returns success.\n"
                "- `where: host` actions are denied in posture=safe|dev.\n"
                "- Queue `backend: kvm` is posture=safe only (today).\n"
                "  (Provider entrypoints in KVM allow safe|dev; host-capable postures fail closed.)\n"
                "\n"
                "Helpers:\n"
                "- Validate YAML only:\n"
