                "- `unsafe`: host actions are allowed via the host gateway (`hostd`) and audited; still no `/host`.\n"
                "- `take-the-wheel`: like `unsafe`, plus mounts host root at `/host` (dangerous).\n"
                "- `bare-metal`: provider runs directly on the host (no sandbox; extremely dangerous).\n"
                "\n"
                "Provider entrypoints also accept posture flags:\n"
                "- `sandworm codex|claude|gemini --posture safe|dev|unsafe|take-the-wheel|bare-metal`\n"
