                "- `--verbose` enables bootstrap progress output (equivalent to `SW_BOOTSTRAP_PROGRESS=1`)\n"
                "\n"
                "The intended contract:\n"
                "- SAFE does not mutate the host outside the workspace root.\n"
                "- SAFE does not use host `$HOME`.\n"
                "- Only explicit shares are mounted into sandboxes.\n"
            ),
