# │  2. HOME is /run/sandworm/home (not the host HOME).                                  │
# │  3. Read /run/sandworm/home/SANDWORM_ENV.md for runtime facts.                       │
# │  4. Read /run/sandworm/home/SANDWORM_RUNBOOK.md for deeper docs.                     │
# │  5. Use `sandworm status` for posture/capability summary.                            │
# │  6. If hidden paths are blocked by file tools, use shell reads (`cat ...`).         │
